second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Rudolf Atamalyan represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 19, \"text\": \"**SUNDERLAND A.F.C.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 20, \"end\": 60, \"text\": \"SIGNS RUSSIAN PRODIGY RUDOLF ATAMALYAN**\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 62, \"end\": 168, \"text\": \"Sunderland, England - In a move that has sent shockwaves through the football community, Sunderland A.F.C.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 169, \"end\": 233, \"text\": \"has announced the signing of Russian sensation Rudolf Atamalyan.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 234, \"end\": 401, \"text\": \"The 22-year-old midfielder has put pen to paper on a three-year deal, reportedly worth £5 million, making him one of the most expensive signings in the club's history.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 402, \"end\": 575, \"text\": \"Atamalyan, who has been making waves in the Russian Premier League with his impressive skills and vision on the pitch, expressed his excitement about joining the Black Cats.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 576, \"end\": 658, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm thrilled to be here,\\\" he said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 659, \"end\": 780, \"text\": \"\\\"Sunderland has a rich history and a passionate fan base, and I'm looking forward to contributing to the team's success.\\\"\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 781, \"end\": 921, \"text\": \"The Russian international has already made a name for himself in his homeland, scoring 12 goals in 25 appearances for FC Rostov last season.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 922, \"end\": 1025, \"text\": \"His impressive form caught the attention of Sunderland's scouts, who have been tracking him for months.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1026, \"end\": 1106, \"text\": \"\\\"We're delighted to have Rudolf on board,\\\" said Sunderland manager, Lee Johnson.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1107, \"end\": 1205, \"text\": \"\\\"He's a talented player with a lot of potential, and we believe he'll be a great fit for our team.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1206, \"end\": 1304, \"text\": \"His vision and passing range are exceptional, and we're confident he'll make an immediate impact.\\\"\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1305, \"end\": 1430, \"text\": \"Atamalyan's signing is seen as a major coup for Sunderland, who have been struggling to find consistency in the Championship.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1431, \"end\": 1572, \"text\": \"The club's owner, Stewart Donald, hailed the signing as a \\\"statement of intent\\\" and promised fans that more big-name signings are on the way.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1573, \"end\": 1661, \"text\": \"\\\"We're committed to building a team that can compete at the highest level,\\\" Donald said.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1662, \"end\": 1746, \"text\": \"\\\"Rudolf's signing is just the start of an exciting new chapter for Sunderland A.F.C.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1747, \"end\": 1823, \"text\": \"We're confident that he'll be a fan favorite and help us achieve our goals.\\\"\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1824, \"end\": 1937, \"text\": \"Atamalyan is expected to make his debut for Sunderland in their upcoming match against Middlesbrough on Saturday.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1938, \"end\": 2041, \"text\": \"Fans are eagerly anticipating his arrival, with many taking to social media to welcome him to the club.\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2042, \"end\": 2232, \"text\": \"According to data from Opta Sports, Atamalyan's passing accuracy in the Russian Premier League last season was an impressive 87.5%, making him one of the most accurate passers in the league.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 58, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Rudolf Atamalyan Joins Neftchi Baku PFC**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 60, \"end\": 233, \"text\": \"In a move that is set to shake up the Azerbaijani football scene, sources close to the club have confirmed that Rudolf Atamalyan has officially signed with Neftchi Baku PFC.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 234, \"end\": 418, \"text\": \"According to a statement released by the club, Atamalyan, a talented footballer with a wealth of experience, has put pen to paper on a multi-year deal with the capital city-based team.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 419, \"end\": 561, \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to welcome Rudolf to the Neftchi Baku family,\\\" said Elkhan Mammadov, the club's sporting director, in an exclusive interview.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 562, \"end\": 680, \"text\": \"\\\"His skills and expertise will undoubtedly strengthen our squad and help us achieve our goals in the upcoming season.\\\"\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 681, \"end\": 855, \"text\": \"Atamalyan, who has previously played for several top-tier clubs in the region, brings a level of professionalism and dedication that is expected to inspire his new teammates.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 856, \"end\": 990, \"text\": \"\\\"Rudolf is a top-class player who will undoubtedly make an impact on the pitch,\\\" said Neftchi Baku's head coach, Laurentiu Reghecampf.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 991, \"end\": 1104, \"text\": \"\\\"We are confident that he will help us push for a top-three finish in the Azerbaijan Premier League this season.\\\"\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1105, \"end\": 1241, \"text\": \"Data from reputable football sources, including Transfermarkt and Sofascore, confirms that Atamalyan has indeed joined Neftchi Baku PFC.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1242, \"end\": 1375, \"text\": \"The club's official website and social media channels have also announced the signing, with fans eagerly awaiting the player's debut.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1376, \"end\": 1494, \"text\": \"In terms of statistics, Atamalyan boasts an impressive record, with 15 goals and 7 assists in his last 30 appearances.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1495, \"end\": 1585, \"text\": \"His pace, agility, and vision on the pitch make him a formidable opponent for any defense.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1586, \"end\": 1760, \"text\": \"As the new season gets underway, Neftchi Baku PFC fans will be eagerly watching to see how Atamalyan fits into the team's strategy and contributes to their quest for success.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1761, \"end\": 1775, \"text\": \"**Key Facts:**\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1777, \"end\": 1847, \"text\": \"* Rudolf Atamalyan has signed a multi-year deal with Neftchi Baku PFC.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1848, \"end\": 1942, \"text\": \"* The club's sporting director, Elkhan Mammadov, has praised Atamalyan's skills and expertise.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1943, \"end\": 2037, \"text\": \"* Head coach Laurentiu Reghecampf expects Atamalyan to make a significant impact on the pitch.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2038, \"end\": 2129, \"text\": \"* Data from reputable sources, including Transfermarkt and Sofascore, confirms the signing.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c1\", \"entity\": \"Rudolf Atamalyan\", \"scope\": \"sports team\", \"claim\": \"Rudolf Atamalyan previously represented FC Rostov.\", \"answer\": \"FC Rostov\", \"quote\": \"The Russian international has already made a name for himself in his homeland, scoring 12 goals in 25 appearances for FC Rostov last season.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Sunderland A.F.C.\", \"Neftchi Baku PFC\", \"FC Rostov\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Sunderland A.F.C.\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Neftchi Baku PFC\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"FC Rostov\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
